WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.779
Presented at ICML 2024, this work tackles
underwater salient instance segmentation.

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:07.614
The authors build USIS10K,

00:00:07.694 --> 00:00:13.826
the first large-scale underwater dataset with ten
thousand pixel-level annotated images,

00:00:13.906 --> 00:00:15.308
and propose USIS-SAM,

00:00:15.388 --> 00:00:21.379
a Segment Anything Model tailored to underwater
scenes that injects visual prompts and

00:00:21.459 --> 00:00:26.320
generates salient prompts automatically to set a
new state of the art.
